Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 20:37:38 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 27/35] feat(hybrid): pass trace and targeted shader dump
 diagnostics

ASTROHYBRID_PASS_TRACE=<s> traces three frames of draws and dispatches
(shader hashes, bound images, render targets); ASTROHYBRID_PASS_TRACE_CB
adds one shader's buffer words; ASTROHYBRID_SHADER_DUMP writes the guest
code and RDNA2 disassembly of listed shaders. All off by default.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
